\nQ - Dash\nR - Combat/Fists\nM1 - Light Punch\nM2 - Heavy Punch\nF - Block & Dodge\nB - Carry \nV - Mount/Grip\nT - Mode\nP - Map Markers (Locations)\n\nController Controls:\nL1+R1 - Inventory\nR1+R2 - Mode\nL2 - Block\nL3 - Run\nR2 - M1\nY - M2\nB - Dash\nA - Jump\nX - Carry\nL1+X - 1\nL1+Y - 2\nL1+B - 3\nR1+X - 4\nR1+Y - 5\nR1+B - 6\nDPadUp - Mount/Grip\nDPadDown - Menu\nDPadLeft - Shift Lock\nDPadRight - Combat","path":"/game/106051943710043-fistborn","slug":"106051943710043-fistborn","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/84038fa06c8a3ef44cfac3831655dcadb43c9bac22aeb852b285109db511015d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3a09b799d9a0616dc0a2ef6507a1f978/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":15253062,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-16T12:43:00.574Z","creator":{"name":"Kengan","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":107397057618236,"name":"👵 Oldies","desc":"They’ve lived long enough to know all the tricks.\nEvery forgotten rule, every cane swing, every half-heard story—they’ve mastered them. These aren’t just elders; they’re legends of the past, ready to show you why they’re still standing.\n\nMade with 💙 by 1CoaI & alextubbaa","path":"/game/107397057618236-oldies","slug":"107397057618236-oldies","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e7790548f45ac0cb7560e8278bb7b5269fd0e1857a4c14db185c64f06e3a9a0a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-995da1138e6e8503032b3074aeb6bf34/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":4977401,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-25T19:10:47.435Z","creator":{"name":"0 CCU Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}}],"totalGames":14204,"totalPages":592,"currentPage":397}